  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "77F2E874C0CC2E21",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)] ! Comment vas-tu ?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "77F2E574C0CC2908",
      "text": "Je vois que tu as attrapé [VAR 0x0202(0001)] espèce[VAR 0x1101(0001,0D00)]s différentes\\nde Pokémon de Septentria ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0202",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "0D00"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "77F2E674C0CC2ABB",
      "text": "Le voyage scolaire commence à peine !\\c\\nExplore tous les recoins de Septentria pour\\ndécouvrir un maximum de Pokémon locaux ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "77F2EB74C0CC333A",
      "text": "Différents Pokémon vivent dans différents\\nclimats, tu sais !\\c\\nComme l’air de Septentria est relativement\\nhumide en été, on y trouve beaucoup\\r\\nde Pokémon qui apprécient l’humidité.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 183,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "77F2EC74C0CC34ED",
      "text": "Apparemment, des gaz volcaniques s’échappent\\ndu sol, dans les hauteurs du Mont Strueux.\\c\\nVoilà qui doit bien plaire aux Pokémon qui\\napprécient les endroits riches en gaz ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 173,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_05_02",
      "hash64": "CC6D265DB8C2E240",
      "text": "Fais bien attention à ne pas les respirer à pleins\\npoumons, hein ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "77F2E974C0CC2FD4",
      "text": "Ouah ! Tu as presque entièrement rempli\\nle Pokédex de Septentria !\\c\\nTu peux le consulter pour voir dans quels habitats\\nse trouvent certains Pokémon, ou bien faire\\r\\ndes raids dans les grottes de cristal...\\c\\nEncore un petit effort et tu complèteras\\nle Pokédex ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 164,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 208,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 265,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "77F2EA74C0CC3187",
      "text": "Mais... Tu as trouvé toutes les espèces\\nde Pokémon !!![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "77F2DF74C0CC1ED6",
      "text": "Cela signifie que le Pokédex de Septentria est\\nmaintenant entièrement rempli ! C’est fabuleux ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "77F2E074C0CC2089",
      "text": "Grâce à toi, je sais désormais tout ce que\\nje voulais savoir sur les Pokémon de Septentria ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_10",
      "hash64": "77F66D74C0CF45F7",
      "text": "J’aimerais te faire un cadeau pour célébrer ça,\\nmais je n’ai pas grand-chose sur moi...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_11",
      "hash64": "77F66C74C0CF4444",
      "text": "Ah si, je sais ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_25",
      "hash64": "77EC5874C0C6CDC3",
      "text": "Voici un souvenir que j’ai acheté au Septemplion.\\nApparemment, c’est une édition limitée ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_12",
      "hash64": "77F66F74C0CF495D",
      "text": "Ensuite, est-ce que tu peux me montrer\\nton Motismart une petite seconde ?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_13",
      "hash64": "77F66E74C0CF47AA",
      "text": "Monsieur Clavel a préparé une mise à jour\\nqui permet aux personnes ayant accompli\\r\\ncet exploit de consulter leur diplôme !\\r\\nJe vais te l’installer.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 151,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_14",
      "hash64": "77F66974C0CF3F2B",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, tu devrais avoir reçu un message\\nde la part de la compagnie qui gère le Pokédex.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_15",
      "hash64": "77F66874C0CF3D78",
      "text": "Tu as beau avoir complété ton Pokédex, ton\\nvoyage scolaire n’est pas terminé pour autant !\\r\\nTes aventures ne font que commencer ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_16",
      "hash64": "77F66B74C0CF4291",
      "text": "J’espère que tu vas continuer de rencontrer\\ndes tas de Pokémon ici, à Septentria ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_17",
      "hash64": "77F66A74C0CF40DE",
      "text": "Quelle magnifique matinée !\\nDe quoi commencer la journée du bon pied.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_18",
      "hash64": "77F66574C0CF385F",
      "text": "La chaleur de Septentria ne pardonne pas !\\nJe suis tout en nage dans ma blouse...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_19",
      "hash64": "77F66474C0CF36AC",
      "text": "Le coucher de soleil de Septentria est tout\\nbonnement magnifique !\\c\\nJe remarque d’ailleurs que la lumière y est plus\\ndiffuse qu’à Paldea... Peut-être que l’indice de\\r\\nréfraction est différent, ici ?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 167,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 202,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_20",
      "hash64": "77EC5B74C0C6D2DC",
      "text": "Quitte à faire des recherches la nuit, autant en\\nprofiter pour observer le ciel !\\c\\nLoin de la lumière des villes, on voit très bien\\nles étoiles ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_21",
      "hash64": "77EC5C74C0C6D48F",
      "text": "Voilà un début de journée bien pluvieux.\\c\\nLes Pokémon qui aiment la pluie doivent être\\naux anges ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_22",
      "hash64": "77EC5D74C0C6D642",
      "text": "Même quand il pleut, la chaleur de Septentria\\nreste étouffante !\\c\\nJe me demande quel est l’impact de ce climat\\nsur l’écosystème local.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_23",
      "hash64": "77EC5E74C0C6D7F5",
      "text": "Cette soirée est placée sous le signe de la pluie !\\c\\nEssaie de ne pas trop tarder à sécher tes\\nvêtements, ou ta température corporelle risque\\r\\nde chuter ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 158,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_24",
      "hash64": "77EC5774C0C6CC10",
      "text": "Entre la pluie qui a rendu le sol glissant\\net la visibilité réduite, il vaut mieux éviter\\r\\nde s’aventurer trop loin, d’accord ?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_stop",
      "hash64": "476DB22077BD9036",
      "text": "Complète ton Pokédex de Septentria\\nen y enregistrant 200 espèces !\\c\\nQuand tu auras réussi, ouvre l’application et\\nappuie sur le [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]bouton X[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] pour obtenir la marque\\r\\nd’achèvement du Pokédex, puis montre-la-moi ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
